  aciklama:
  - "<color=yellow>Bug\xFCn i\xE7in ya\u015Fam yolu say\u0131n 7.</color>\n\nHayat
    denizinin derinlerine dal\u0131p varl\u0131\u011F\u0131na inand\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    mercanlar\u0131 arayabilirsin bug\xFCn. Olaylar\u0131n hikmetini, insanlar\u0131n
    niyetini, att\u0131\u011F\u0131n ad\u0131mlar\u0131n ak\u0131betini sorgulayacaks\u0131n.
    Yaln\u0131z ba\u015F\u0131na uzay bo\u015Flu\u011Funda sal\u0131nd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    hisseden ruhun, duvarlar\u0131n arkas\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6rerek uyan\u0131\u015Fa
    ge\xE7mek i\xE7in \xE7abalayacak."
